     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I was wondering if it&#39;s possible to retrieve the filtering status of a DataTable.  I want to be able to know the exact state of a dataset being rendered in a DataTable, so if the user clicked on one of the columns to sort by that variable or if the user entered a filter string into some of the filter boxes underneath, I want to know that as well.</div><div><br></div><div>Does anyone know how to do that?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Example ui.R:</div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> actionButton</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;actionBtn&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;What&#39;s in the table?&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;output&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> br</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">outputId </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;table&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div>Example server.R:</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> output$table </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> iris<br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> output$output </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderText</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> input$actionBtn<br> <br> paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Table parameters: ???&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
